# .env - defaults for the repo's .stack, a sub-daemon hung as row repo-aos under the ~/aos-home root (a value the daemon above already passed down wins); every agent under it inherits them.
# AOS_CLOCK comes from the daemon above; not set here on purpose: the clock is only in the root (started alone as a root, this tree has no clock).
# AOS_LLM_KERNEL comes from the repo-aos row (ctl add --envs; each machine runs its own llm kernel outside the repo); see the machine-move manual linked from wf/tree/README.md.
# No AOS_LLM_KERNEL default on purpose: if the row forgot to pass it, an agent's first brain call stops with LlmKernelMissing instead of waiting on a folder that does not exist.
# Do not set AOS_KERNEL here: the permission station belongs to each machine, not to this repo (see the manual).
# AOS_HOME is the proto8 folder these files point into; export it, or uncomment the next line and set it here.
# AOS_HOME=${HOME}/repo/aos/proto8
AOS_HOME=${AOS_HOME}
